    "child_row": "A row in a child table, keyed as the note says.",
    "source_reference": "SOURCE_REFERENCE tier: the raw payload stays at the source; the LMS keeps the reference, sha256 and fetch time.",
    "doctype_rows": "Rows of a whole doctype linked to the application."
  },
